1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,880
MotionQA: evidence-backed PCB anomaly inspection.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,380
By team Kia Kiu, Institut Teknologi Bandung.

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,420
Can you spot the defect?

4
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:14,330
One bent pin. Just 0.13 percent of the model input.

5
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:19,060
A bare PASS or FAIL does not say why.

6
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:23,990
MotionQA keeps the reason,
the score and the evidence.

7
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:29,150
Here is how it decides.
Every photo follows one path.

8
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:33,750
Bad photos are retaken. Unsure cases go to a person.

9
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:37,990
This is the real app, running locally.

10
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:41,480
A good board scores under the PASS line.

11
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:49,590
Bent pins score over the FAIL line.

12
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:55,010
A reviewer confirms. The machine
decision stays on record.

13
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,460
A blurry photo gets RETAKE in the same session.

14
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:08,230
The sharp retake passes. Three
failed tries go to a person.

15
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:14,630
Under the hood: one photo,
step by step, in OpenCV 5.

16
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,310
Find the board. Check the focus.

17
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:24,450
Crop it and extract features
with the new DNN engine.

18
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,850
Compare patches with normal boards,
and mark what looks different.

19
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:40,600
Now the hard cases. This good board
lands just over the PASS line.

20
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:44,280
Too close to call, so a person decides.

21
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:49,030
A known miss: board 048 lost a pin, and it passes.

22
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:55,430
The hottest spot is on the
transducer, not the missing pin.

23
00:01:56,900 --> 00:01:59,580
This weakness is documented and unfixed.

24
00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:06,760
Board 043 lost both transducers.
The model is unsure it is the part.

25
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:14,230
An older policy said NO_PART. Now it
goes to REVIEW, and it stays in all 153.

26
00:02:15,300 --> 00:02:17,990
The same app runs live on AWS.

27
00:02:19,900 --> 00:02:22,590
Without a token, only the status shows.

28
00:02:23,300 --> 00:02:27,530
The model is ready on OpenCV 5,
and health checks pass.

29
00:02:30,300 --> 00:02:33,060
A photo enters through CloudFront and nginx.

30
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:40,490
FastAPI runs the OpenCV steps
on one Graviton instance.

31
00:02:41,600 --> 00:02:45,610
Evidence goes to S3. The record goes to PostgreSQL.

32
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:51,070
Secrets Manager holds the token.
CloudFormation built the stack.

33
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:55,250
On October 16, twenty test images ran on AWS.

34
00:02:55,700 --> 00:02:58,390
All twenty answers matched the local run.

35
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:04,650
The data is the public VisA
benchmark, on AWS Open Data.

36
00:03:05,900 --> 00:03:09,550
Good boards build the memory.
Validation sets the lines.

37
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:14,780
153 test images give the results.

38
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:20,050
Each dot is one test image, placed by its score.

39
00:03:21,700 --> 00:03:25,160
Two lines make three zones: PASS, REVIEW and FAIL.

40
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:31,880
One of 53 defective boards passed.
Four of 100 good boards failed.

41
00:03:32,900 --> 00:03:35,220
41 images went to a person.

42
00:03:36,900 --> 00:03:42,780
Image AUROC is 0.9745. A
ranking score, not accuracy.

43
00:03:42,900 --> 00:03:50,930
The OpenCV-only baseline ranks lower, 0.8689.
It misses none, but rejects and reviews more.

44
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:55,140
We tuned capture gates after seeing test results.

45
00:03:55,300 --> 00:03:58,800
So these are development
results, not an independent test.

46
00:04:00,500 --> 00:04:03,640
MotionQA is tested on this benchmark only.

47
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:10,460
About one in three good boards goes to REVIEW.

48
00:04:13,100 --> 00:04:15,410
Some missing parts can still pass.

49
00:04:19,400 --> 00:04:24,400
Scan the code to open the live endpoint.
Judges get the token privately.

50
00:04:25,900 --> 00:04:30,130
The code, the data files and
this video's sources are public.

51
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:34,880
MotionQA, by team Kia Kiu. Thank you.
